{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packing turns into a fun and rewarding puzzle. As a warehouse worker, organize, rotate, and fit items into boxes, making each order neat and efficient. With limited space and unique product shapes, every package becomes a satisfying challenge. Along the way, experience a heartfelt story, unlock new items, and customize your workspace. Enjoy a cozy, relaxing experience with soothing visuals and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/cab82984f5cdc694fc5582eab4ff5e05.poster.avif?t=1772813922\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/cab82984f5cdc694fc5582eab4ff5e05.webm?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/cab82984f5cdc694fc5582eab4ff5e05.mp4?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Packing Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate, arrange, and fit items perfectly into boxes for the most efficient and satisfying packing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Heartfelt Story</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the journey of a warehouse worker striving to build a better future. Experience small yet meaningful moments, uncovering the stories behind each package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c9872fb084562af9234af02d159e13ca.poster.avif?t=1772813922\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c9872fb084562af9234af02d159e13ca.webm?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c9872fb084562af9234af02d159e13ca.mp4?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; Vibrant Art Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, visually appealing design with soft colors and inviting aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Reward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock stickers and collectibles by completing orders with precision and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/698a84a61faaa7cc78b8aa8d5de41124.poster.avif?t=1772813922\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/698a84a61faaa7cc78b8aa8d5de41124.webm?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/698a84a61faaa7cc78b8aa8d5de41124.mp4?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound &amp; Music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of relaxing music and immersive sound effects makes for a calming and enjoyable gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workspace Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize the packing station with decorations and themes to create a unique and inviting workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c7c4d1e7655669ac93f3d230d8da3ba5.poster.avif?t=1772813922\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c7c4d1e7655669ac93f3d230d8da3ba5.webm?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c7c4d1e7655669ac93f3d230d8da3ba5.mp4?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Yet Engaging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, yet rewarding for players who enjoy optimizing and perfecting their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/8cb60c20f182bebaa9fa8780922fd6a6.poster.avif?t=1772813922\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/8cb60c20f182bebaa9fa8780922fd6a6.webm?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/8cb60c20f182bebaa9fa8780922fd6a6.mp4?t=1772813922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Box Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3482510/4b699d140503b9fed6677cf77e48770a4fc3c45b.jpg"},{"name":"Box Buddy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3482510/b87b8b2765dd0a6d34ba3a96be5e6de9660c9616.jpg"},{"name":"Box Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3482510/22f4f37d0fe219facd3a3ee53d6c344781c81dd4.jpg"},{"name":"Box Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3482510/8d8422eb4303f8ded9c6b8f7f8822e0289e763ed.jpg"},{"name":"Box Lover","path"